# =============================================================================
# Kubernetes Security Audit - Memory Monitor Log
# =============================================================================
#
# Purpose:
#   Resource usage tracking log capturing memory consumption of security
#   scanning tools at 60-second intervals. Enables constraint validation
#   against 16GB total and 12GB per-tool limits.
#
# Monitoring Constraints (per Agent Action Plan Section 0.9.5):
#   - Total memory usage MUST stay <16GB
#   - Individual tool processes MUST NOT exceed 12GB
#   - Resource monitoring interval: 60 seconds
#   - SIGTERM/SIGKILL triggered with parallelism reduction if limits exceeded
#
# Log Format:
#   [HH:MM:SS] Memory usage: X.XX GB (total) | trivy: X.XX GB | gosec: X.XX GB | semgrep: X.XX GB
#   [HH:MM:SS] WARNING: Process <name> approaching limit (X.XX GB / 12.00 GB)
#   [HH:MM:SS] CRITICAL: Memory limit exceeded - triggering scope reduction
#
# Monitoring Script (from Section 0.9.5):
#   while true; do
#     MEMORY_USAGE=$(ps aux | grep -E 'trivy|gosec|semgrep' | awk '{sum+=$6} END {printf "%.2f GB", sum/1024/1024}')
#     echo "[$(date +%H:%M:%S)] Memory usage: $MEMORY_USAGE" >> /audit-results/logs/memory-monitor.log
#     sleep 60
#   done &
#   MONITOR_PID=$!
#
# Cleanup:
#   kill $MONITOR_PID 2>/dev/null  # Stop monitor after audit completion
#
# Fields:
#   - Timestamp: Time of measurement in [HH:MM:SS] format
#   - Total Memory: Aggregate memory consumption across all scanner processes
#   - Per-Tool Breakdown: Individual memory usage when approaching limits
#   - Status Indicators: WARNING (>80% of limit), CRITICAL (limit exceeded)
#
# Tool Process Names Monitored:
#   - trivy: Dependency scanning, SBOM generation, misconfiguration detection
#   - gosec: Go AST/SSA static security analysis
#   - semgrep: Multi-language pattern-based security scanning
#
# Threshold Actions:
#   - >9.6GB per tool (80%): Log WARNING, increase monitoring frequency
#   - >12GB per tool: SIGTERM, wait 10s, SIGKILL if needed, reduce parallelism
#   - >12.8GB total (80%): Log WARNING, prepare scope reduction
#   - >16GB total: Halt non-critical scans, prioritize Critical/High analysis
#
# Scope Reduction Fallback (if limits exceeded):
#   Priority 1: cmd/kube-apiserver/** - Critical authentication/authorization
#   Priority 2: pkg/kubelet/** - Node-level security critical
#   Priority 3: cmd/kubelet/** - Kubelet entrypoint
#   Priority 4: pkg/controller/** - Controller security
#   Priority 5: plugin/pkg/admission/** - Admission plugins (if capacity)
#
# =============================================================================
# Memory Monitoring Log Entries Begin Below
# =============================================================================
